 only the AI agent role granted. So even secondary role grants to your own personal user cannot widen its blast radius. And to be clear, this build is not a complete defense. It protects against AI provider data exposure and AI user privilege. It does not protect against other forms of attack, say like prompt injection, where an attacker tries to trick the AI into running a query you did not authorize. However, it can help mitigate dangerous access to info you do not want to expose in the case that does happen. If this was helpful, please hit the like button and subscribe. I make videos like this almost every week. As you can tell, this one took a little while given I'm in a different place from where I started at the beginning of this video. But I hope this really helps with data professionals and people who are working with sensitive data. That way, we can create the most protected setup possible for all the sensitive data that we work with. As always, thank you so much and I'll see you in the next one.

