| BigQuery documents RLS side channels, limitations, and policy removal behavior that can temporarily widen access. | Best practices for row-level security | Google Cloud | updated 2026-09-03; accessed 2026-09-11 | [Google Cloud](https://docs.cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/best-practices-row-level-security) | T2 | Side-channel and removal/recreation guidance | Prefer separate curated tables for the highest-sensitivity cross-boundary cases; report RLS as a control with limits. | high |
